        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Review Reportee SR Synopsis"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776239864331"
          },
          "code": "REVIEW_REPORTEE_SR_SYNOPSIS",
          "id": "1776239791377",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776239791378_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the service request context {{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_SR_DATA.$output.result}}, generate a concise, structured summary for a service manager.\n\n`Action`: {{$context.$nodes.FORM_ACTION_PARAM_INFO_QUERY.$output.result.action}}\n`SRnumber`: {{$context.$nodes.FORM_ACTION_PARAM_INFO_QUERY.$output.result.srNumber}}\n`RecommendedAgentName`: {{$context.$nodes.FORM_ACTION_PARAM_INFO_QUERY.$output.result.assigneeName}}\n`RecommendedAgentPartyId`: {{$context.$nodes.FORM_ACTION_PARAM_INFO_QUERY.$output.result.assigneeId}}\n`CurrentAssigneeName`: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SR_INFO.$output.items[0].AssigneePersonName}}\n`Reason`: {{$context.$nodes.FORM_ACTION_PARAM_INFO_QUERY.$output.result.reason}}\n`SrRecord`: {{$context.$nodes.FORM_ACTION_PARAM_INFO_QUERY.$output.result.record}}\n\n\nFirst, generate texts that include the following 4 sections:\n\n1. Section title: SR summary\nWrite a concise single-paragraph summary of the SR and what has happened so far. This section must always appear first and must not be omitted. Include SRnumber as well.\n\n2. Section title: “Service request was created <relative time> ago”\nNote: Calculate the relative time from the SR creation timestamp using the current date and time {{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}} (e.g., “18 hours ago”).\nInclude affected product and description of the issue\n\n3. Section Title:\n- If both AccountPartyUniqueName and AccountScoringTier are available:\n  \"{{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_SR_DATA.$output.result[0].AccountPartyUniqueName}} is a Tier {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_ACCOUNT_SCORE.$output.items[0].AccountScoringTier}} account\"\n- If AccountPartyUniqueName is available but AccountScoringTier is not:\n  \"{{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_SR_DATA.$output.result[0].AccountPartyUniqueName}}\"\n- Otherwise:\n  \"Account information is unavailable\"\n\nInclude:\n- Open SR count: {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPEN_SR_COUNT_FOR_ACCOUNT.$output.count}}, only if account information is available.\n- Contact information, only if explicitly available\n\n4. Section Title:\n- If AssigneePersonName is available:\n  \"Assigned to {{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_SR_DATA.$output.result[0].AssigneePersonName}} who has {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPEN_SR_COUNT_FOR_ASSIGNEE.$output.count}} open SR{{ $context.$nodes.GET_OPEN_SR_COUNT_FOR_ASSIGNEE.$output.count === 1 ? '' : 's' }}\"\n- Otherwise:\n  \"Assignee information is unavailable\"\nUse only the information explicitly provided in the data. Do not infer, assume, or generate missing values.\n\nFormatting Guidelines:\n\n- Use the SR title as the main title and bold it.\n- Make each section title a top-level bullet point and bold it.\n- Place all details under each section as nested bullet points (indented one level).\n- Prioritize important operational and customer impact details.\n- Keep the tone concise and actionable.\n\nSecond, generate an <oraInsight> in new row\n{\n  \"title\": \"<Pick Action text based on `Action`. Reassign to <`RecommendedAgentName`> or Add <`RecommendedAgentName`> as Team Member.>\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\"<`Action`>\", {\"action\":\"<`Action`>\",\"srNumber\":\"<`SRnumber`>\", \"assigneeId\":<`RecommendedAgentPartyId`>, \"assigneeName\":<`RecommendedAgentName`>,\"currentAssigneeName\":<`CurrentAssigneeName`>,\"reason\":<`Reason`>}) \"\n}\n\nGenerate another <oraInsight> in same row with space between\n{\n  \"title\": \"Who else is qualified?\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\"ShowAlternatives\",{\"action\":\"ShowAlternatives\",\"record\":<`SrRecord`>\"})\"\n}\n\nEnsure that all four sections are included, and add the button at the end."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Review Non Reportee SR Synopsis"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775643153912"
          },
          "code": "REVIEW_NON_REPORTEE_SR_SYNOPSIS",
          "id": "1776239899641",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776239899643_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the service request context {{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_SR_DATA.$output.result}}, generate a concise, structured summary for a service manager.\n\nFirst, generate texts that include the following 4 sections:\n\n1. Section title: SR summary\nWrite a concise single-paragraph summary of the SR and what has happened so far. This section must always appear first and must not be omitted.\n\n2. Section title: “Service request was created <relative time> ago”\nNote: Calculate the relative time from the SR creation timestamp using the current date and time {{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}} (e.g., “18 hours ago”).\nInclude affected product and description of the issue\n\n3. Section Title:\n- If both AccountPartyUniqueName and AccountScoringTier are available:\n  \"{{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_SR_DATA.$output.result[0].AccountPartyUniqueName}} is a Tier {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_ACCOUNT_SCORE.$output.items[0].AccountScoringTier}} account\"\n- If AccountPartyUniqueName is available but AccountScoringTier is not:\n  \"{{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_SR_DATA.$output.result[0].AccountPartyUniqueName}}\"\n- Otherwise:\n  \"Account information is unavailable\"\n\nInclude:\n- Open SR count: {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPEN_SR_COUNT_FOR_ACCOUNT.$output.count}}, only if account information is available.\n- Contact information, only if explicitly available\n\n4. Section Title:\n- If AssigneePersonName is available:\n  \"Assigned to {{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_SR_DATA.$output.result[0].AssigneePersonName}} who has {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPEN_SR_COUNT_FOR_ASSIGNEE.$output.count}} open SR{{$context.$nodes.GET_OPEN_SR_COUNT_FOR_ASSIGNEE.$output.count === 1 ? '' : 's' }}\"\n- Otherwise:\n  \"Assignee information is unavailable\"\nUse only the information explicitly provided in the data. Do not infer, assume, or generate missing values.\n\nFormatting Guidelines:\n\n- Use the SR title as the main title and bold it.\n- Make each section title a top-level bullet point and bold it.\n- Place all details under each section as nested bullet points (indented one level).\n- Prioritize important operational and customer impact details.\n- Keep the tone concise and actionable.\n\nEnsure that all four sections are included."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
